      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The idea of leaving feels like the only way to prove you care, but that's a twisted way to define love. True love isn't about erasing yourself; it's about being seen, even when you feel broken. Instead of thinking about how you can *take* away their suffering, consider what small thing you could do right now to ease your own immediate pain. You deserve to be cared for, just as much as they do.",
